  "description": "The Innokin Endura T20 S Prism Tank is a versatile vaping solution for MTL (mouth-to-lung) fans who also like to experiment with DTL (direct-to-lung) vaping. With a 2ml e-liquid capacity, it caters to your daily vaping needs and is suitable for vapers of all experience levels. Constructed from high-grade stainless steel and reinforced with premium Pyrex glass, the T20S Tank stands out for its durability and sleek design. The top fill system simplifies the refilling process, while the innovative No Spill Coil Swap system minimizes leakage for a mess-free vaping experience. The tank is optimized for low-wattage vaping and comes with a pre-installed 0.8 Ohm Prism-S coil and an additional 1.5 Ohm Prism T20 coil , offering flexibility in your vaping style. The fixed dual airflow system ensures consistent cloud production and a satisfying draw. Ideal for high PG e-liquids of 50% and above, the Prism T20S Tank delivers excellent flavour and vapour production, making it a top choice for those who prioritise quality and performance in their vaping journey. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
